        "reviewRating": {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "ratingValue": "4"
        },
        "reviewBody": "I found the recipe rather tasty.  I actually really liked it. The only problem we had was getting 5 ounces of chorizo out of a 9 ounce package. So my husband decided to use the entire 9 ounce package. Still was delicious.  I wonder why also it’s only three servings.  When I added the recipes ingredients exactly into my tracker, the calories came out to be 394 instead of the 654 it claimed. That was before altering the chorizo.  I would check and alter the calories on this based on reading all the labels on the packages.  But as for the recipe itself, I would totally make this again and it was very good.  Only reason it’s four stars versus five because five I look at it is perfection like I would eat it every day. Four star is it’s good. I can have it again and I plan to.",
